Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:28.29,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to debut as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}And become the ideal princess.
